- Not at all.

19
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,795
I think we should send her
the address right now.

20
00:01:26,878 --> 00:01:28,546
- I'll send it.
- Is it this one?

21
00:01:28,630 --> 00:01:31,883
Gosh, I haven't been abroad in a while,
so I forgot how to speak English.

22
00:01:32,592 --> 00:01:34,719
I was struggling to speak English,

23
00:01:34,803 --> 00:01:36,429
so I was a bit flustered.

24
00:01:36,513 --> 00:01:38,473
To the young viewers
who are watching this,

25
00:01:38,556 --> 00:01:40,391
study hard while you're still young.

26
00:01:40,475 --> 00:01:42,769
It's hard to learn when you're older.

27
00:01:43,478 --> 00:01:47,524
