42
00:02:13,508 --> 00:02:14,551
For toughing it out.

43
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:17,554
Well, we didn't know
there would be more guests.

44
00:02:17,637 --> 00:02:18,763
Exactly.

45
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:23,518
THE BOSS PUTS OUT HIS FAVORITE PICTURE

