- True.

70
00:03:54,192 --> 00:03:56,236
- Right, we saw that.
- We can't get soft.

71
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:59,614
If it were Jin, I'm sure
he would've locked the door.

72
00:04:00,198 --> 00:04:01,199
You shouldn't compromise.

73
