- Hello.
- Hello.

140
00:07:01,796 --> 00:07:02,922
- Yeah.
- I'm a fan.

141
00:07:03,005 --> 00:07:03,840
Nice to meet you.

142
00:07:14,350 --> 00:07:16,185
- Okay.
- Most recently.

143
00:07:16,269 --> 00:07:17,103
Nepal?

144
00:07:17,812 --> 00:07:19,647
- You're close.
- You're close.

145
00:07:22,233 --> 00:07:23,359
Yes.

146
00:07:23,443 --> 00:07:24,527
Yes.

147
00:07:25,903 --> 00:07:27,071
