- Thank you.

164
00:08:02,648 --> 00:08:04,275
We really enjoyed Season 1.

165
00:08:04,358 --> 00:08:05,693
- Really?
- Yes.

166
00:08:05,776 --> 00:08:08,112
We saw how getting into the house
was the toughest part.

167
00:08:08,196 --> 00:08:09,697
