- 84! Sorry, numbers are still confusing.

176
00:08:25,213 --> 00:08:26,255
Gosh, 48.

177
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:30,009
I watched the old show you were on
so many times.

178
00:08:30,092 --> 00:08:31,427
- Really?
- Yes.

179
00:08:31,969 --> 00:08:32,803
Thank you.

180
00:08:33,387 --> 00:08:34,305
Nice to meet you!

181
00:08:36,724 --> 00:08:37,850
I'm shy.

182
00:08:37,934 --> 00:08:38,976
I'm off to cook.

183
