00:33:03,940 --> 00:33:06,943
Actually, I was a monk about 15 years ago.

799
00:33:07,026 --> 00:33:09,028
- Really?
- Yes, I entered the temple then.

800
00:33:09,112 --> 00:33:12,991
While studying Buddhism, I thought
I needed more real-world experience,

801
00:33:13,074 --> 00:33:14,575
so I told the senior monk.

802
00:33:14,659 --> 00:33:18,204
And now, I'm a <i>Sunmudo</i> instructor
and a Dharma Teacher.

803
00:33:18,287 --> 00:33:19,414
That's fascinating.

804
00:33:19,497 --> 00:33:21,374
Then, do you drink?

805
00:33:21,457 --> 00:33:23,418
I do all those fun things
in the material world,

806
00:33:23,501 --> 00:33:27,171
and when things get hard,
I go to the temple and purify myself.

807
00:33:27,255 --> 00:33:28,923
I can never leave the material world.

808
00:33:29,757 --> 00:33:31,009
I'm attached to so many things.

809
00:33:31,092 --> 00:33:35,054
No, I'm also in the middle
between the material world and Buddhism

810
00:33:35,138 --> 00:33:37,140
and living my life the best I can.

811
00:33:37,223 --> 00:33:40,476
I should pray to the Buddha
before I go to bed tonight.

812
00:33:40,560 --> 00:33:41,394
Right.

813
00:33:42,770 --> 00:33:45,565
Buddha, please guide us
to do this well without any trouble.

814
00:33:51,779 --> 00:33:52,739
It's too hot.

815
00:33:54,741 --> 00:33:57,577
ESCAPING THE SAUNA

816
00:33:57,660 --> 00:33:58,828
It's too hot. I'm dying.

817
00:33:58,911 --> 00:34:00,538
Yes, you can have beer if you want.

818
00:34:00,621 --> 00:34:01,539
BOSS ESCAPES SAUNA TOO

819
00:34:01,622 --> 00:34:03,708
