YEON-KOUNG COMES OUT AFTER A SHOWER

834
00:34:48,628 --> 00:34:50,379
AFTER PUTTING ON NEW SOCKS

835
00:34:51,631 --> 00:34:53,049
SHE SEES THE BOSS LYING DOWN

836
00:34:53,132 --> 00:34:54,383
