869
00:35:56,904 --> 00:35:57,738
Really?

870
00:35:57,822 --> 00:35:59,031
GUEST JUN-HO
5 DAYS, 4 NIGHTS

871
00:35:59,115 --> 00:36:00,741
SNEHAL, SMITA
4 DAYS, 3 NIGHTS

872
00:36:00,825 --> 00:36:02,451
HEE-JEONG, JAE-EUN
3 DAYS, 2 NIGHTS

