890
00:36:39,447 --> 00:36:41,824
RUNNING TRAIL
FROM RUNNING BEGINNERS TO FANATICS

891
00:36:41,908 --> 00:36:43,910
EVERYONE CAN ENJOY IT TOGETHER

892
00:36:43,993 --> 00:36:46,954
