955
00:39:18,939 --> 00:39:20,941
Boss, did you wash up?
Did you brush your teeth?

956
00:39:21,025 --> 00:39:22,651
And change your underwear.

957
00:39:22,735 --> 00:39:24,278
Yeon-koung's quite funny.

958
00:39:25,988 --> 00:39:27,281
She's funny.

959
00:39:27,365 --> 00:39:29,283
