- Or it won't turn off.

1032
00:42:56,282 --> 00:42:57,199
Is that it?

1033
00:42:57,283 --> 00:42:58,242
You're so cool.

1034
00:42:58,325 --> 00:42:59,326
You have to hit it hard.

1035
00:42:59,910 --> 00:43:01,245
You need to hit it hard.

1036
00:43:01,328 --> 00:43:02,580
Good night, everyone!

1037
00:43:06,500 --> 00:43:08,460
