1639
01:10:42,947 --> 01:10:45,074
- They're so small.
- Are they sleeping?

1640
01:10:45,157 --> 01:10:46,325
They're so cute.

1641
01:10:47,910 --> 01:10:49,453
- It's a baby.
- It's so cute.

1642
01:10:52,164 --> 01:10:54,625
They're so cute.

1643
01:10:55,334 --> 01:10:56,627
The lambs are so cute.

