1679
01:12:02,401 --> 01:12:05,487
You can come after 4:00 p.m.
How many of you are there?

1680
01:12:05,571 --> 01:12:06,864
<i>- I'm by myself.</i>
- By yourself?

1681
01:12:07,448 --> 01:12:08,407
Okay, bye.

