- Hold onto me.
- Okay.

1711
01:13:24,108 --> 01:13:24,942
Hold on.

1712
01:13:25,526 --> 01:13:26,985
- One, two, three.
- One, two, three.

1713
01:13:32,449 --> 01:13:33,784
- It's working.
- It's working.

1714
01:13:35,661 --> 01:13:37,079
- It's working.
- It's working.

1715
01:13:37,162 --> 01:13:38,288
Come on. Hurry.

1716
01:13:38,372 --> 01:13:41,333
- Hurry.
- I got it.

1717
